{
 "total": 40.386,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.614,
   "texto": "Treated wood in your raised bed? That's poison!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.764,
   "b": 5.15,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo is about to lose this one!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 5.27,
   "b": 8.423,
   "texto": "It's soaked in chemicals! Arsenic! Your tomatoes drink it!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.543,
   "b": 13.368,
   "texto": "That was the old stuff. Arsenic treated wood was pulled from home use at the end of 2003.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 13.488,
   "b": 15.381,
   "texto": "So the new wood is totally clean?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 15.481,
   "b": 17.537,
   "texto": "Not totally. Today it's treated with copper.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.637,
   "b": 21.029,
   "texto": "Oregon State built garden beds with it, and tested the soil for years.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 21.149,
   "b": 23.904,
   "texto": "The extra copper stayed within about one inch of the boards.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 24.024,
   "b": 25.908,
   "texto": "And the vegetables? No copper buildup.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 26.058,
   "b": 27.768,
   "texto": "Okay. So where's the catch?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 27.868,
   "b": 32.108,
   "texto": "Never use old boards from before 2004. And plant a few inches in from the wood.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 32.258,
   "b": 33.976,
   "texto": "Fine. My tomatoes live.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.176,
   "b": 38.13,
   "texto": "Treated wood in your raised bed. Safe, or poison? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 38.33,
   "b": 40.386,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
